onal"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m017-0488","start":488,"end":489,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m017-0514","start":514,"end":517,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m017-0543","start":543,"end":544,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m017-0563","start":563,"end":564,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","book_id":"b-shiji-118","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p023","text":"於是廷尉以王孫建辭連淮南王太子遷聞。上遣廷尉監因拜淮南中尉，逮捕太子。至淮南，淮南王聞，與太子謀召相、二千石，欲殺而發兵。召相，相至；內史以出為解。中尉曰：「臣受詔使，不得見王。」王念獨殺相而內史中尉不來，無益也，即罷相。王猶豫，計未決。太子念所坐者謀刺漢中尉，所與謀者已死，以為口絕，乃謂王曰：「群臣可用者皆前繋，今無足與舉事者。王以非時發，恐無功，臣願會逮。」王亦偷欲休，即許太子。太子即自剄，不殊。伍被自詣吏，因告與淮南王謀反，反蹤跡具如此。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"王孫建","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"太子遷","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"廷尉監","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0025","start":25,"end":29,"surface":"淮南中尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m023-0032","start"